e rather nasty mail to a certain MUD administrator out of due frustration.I will more likely than not be logging on, as I am sure my character willbe destroyed.  I hope I am able to log on and see you all a few more times.If not, my email address is eknabel@ucs.indiana.edu .  Graduation has beencruel in that no one writes me any more!  I still exist, and I long for mail!  Please help me{_!  IF you cannot reach me, talk to Darastorand he will more than likely know how to reach me.  If I am not banished,then{it will be business as usual.  Also, appeal to Herp to lift thesite ban of Bloomington, for the lag is terrible going through anotherconnection!!  Then again, he might just close the mud down again...Oh well... have fun, and I hope to see you soon!!!!!!!!!!!!HUH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! ElvisPS: I'm stirring the paint, Eppie...your days of safety are dwindling!!!!**Well, dearie, I'm putting on those paint-splattered overalls and my cap.Where'd I leave those paint brushes???? *ponders***Hey!  It's me, BEEZ!  I've missed you guys, and, apparently while I'vebeen away some of my fellow Hoosiers have been not-so-nice and gotten lil'old IU in some mud-trouble.   Well, I had nothing to do with it, andI will be on the game sporadically (as soon as I can get my passwordchanged because I totally forget what it is.)  Anyway, I've missed you guysand I HOPE (it depends on the Herp-meister) that I will be seeing y'allfairly soon, now that I have found other means of avoiding the IUsite ban.  :)He's BAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACK!The Beezster....**ch ch ch chiait's the pottery that grows!**ummm..i'm wondering why i got a chia pet for christmas anywaysanybody want it???...(please?!)*grin*hey ep how did you leave that note on the 29th when it isn't even the29th yet?maybe i'm just a day behind as uusual yet eh?oh well whatever...c ya monks around...l8r**Someone needs to water Eponine.*grin***Happy f'n b-day to meI'm just he