m:  ... And the Lord said \"Let there be Shit\"... and there came              piles of it...              After six days of shit, He rested.Darwinism:  This shit evolved.Descartesianism:  Excreto Ergo Sum  (I Shit therefore I am).Environmentalism:  Recycle this shit.Fatalism:  Not this shit AGAIN!Fortran:        IF (SHIT.GT.SHIT**2) GO TO 50                                     \\\\\\\\\\                 ..................                 ..................          50    CALL SHITPOT(SHIT,RSHIT,DSHIT(1))Green Peace:  Save this shit!Hare Krishna:  Shit happens, Rama, Rama, Om, Om.               Let all shit of the world unite to form a single global               pile of shit.Hedonism:  When shit happens, enjoy it.Heisenbergism:  Shit happened, we just don't know where.Hinduism:  This shit happened before.           This shit is not a religion, it is the way of life.Hippyism:  If shit happens, make peace with it.Iraqi Baathist:  Oh SHIT!Islam:  If this shit happens, it is the will of Allah.Jehovah's Witnesses:  There is only a limited amount of good shit.                      No shit happens until Armageddon.Jesuitism:  If this shit happens and noone is around, then did it happen?Jimism: You're in deep shit. Everyone roll d20.Judaism:  Why does shit always happen to us?Kennedyism:  Ask not what the country's shit can do for you, ask what             your shit can do for the country.Lutheranism:  If shit happens, have faith, and it will stop happening.Marie Antoinette'ism:  If they can't afford bread, why don't they get                       get shit instead                       (note: that's the real reason she got the                        guillotine)Mathematics:  Necessary and sufficient conditions for shit to occur are:              1) Shit must exist and be continuous in a domain D              2) No shit must exceed ^SHIT^ on the boundary of DMcCarthyism:  Are you now, or have you ever been, shit?              This shit is un-American, it must testify against all other              communist shit.McLaineism:  This shit has happened to me before.Militarism:  Shit happens.  By the numbers.Mormon:  Hey, there's more shit over here!         This shit happened before, and will happen again.Naziism:  If shit happens, blame it on the Jews and gas them.New Age:  A firm shit does not happen to me.          This isn't shit if I really believe it's chocolate.          I create my own shit.          If shit happens, buy a new crystal.Nixonism:  Shit didn't happen, and if it did, I didn't know anything           about it.Optimism:  Let's look at the bright side of this shit...           Shit happens only once.Orwellianism:  Some shit is more equal than other shit.               I am an agent of shit.Paranoia:  Shit happens 'cos it's a plot.Pessimism:  No good ever came out of shit and this shit ain't any good            either.            Shit happens forever.Politics (election time):  Shit happens to my opponent.         (term in office):  I recall no shit happening.         (retired):  We all knew shit happened.Presbyterianism:  If shit has to happen, let it happen to someone else.Protestantism:  Let shit happen to someone else.Psychiatry:  Take this Thorazine and don't worry about your shit anymore.Psychology:  I can help you deal with your shit.Punkism:  If shit happens, cause more!!!!!Rand Objectivism:  Shit is shit.Rastafarian:  Let's roll that shit up and smoke it.Realism:  I think I need to take a shit.Reform Judaism:  Got any laxatives?Republicanism:  If shit happens, raise the taxes.Seventh Day Adventism:  Shit happens every day but Saturday.                        Work hard and on Saturday shit happens.                        *(I know they contradict... makes ya think,                          doesn't it?  :)   )Soonerism (University of Oklahoma):  If you ain't fer the Sooners, you   